    "viz_intro": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## Wind Compass\n\nDraws current wind direction and speed on a compass dial. Give it a city name and it fetches the weather itself — no index, search or setup needed. Or feed it a search of your own data instead.\n\nThe panels below show the same visualization in three skins, in dark and light themes, and with the dial switched off.",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent",
        "fontColor": "#e6ecf4"
      }
    },
    "viz_live_card": {
      "type": "splunk.rectangle",
      "options": {
        "fillColor": "#193332",
        "fillOpacity": 1,
        "strokeColor": "#2ec2b8",
        "strokeOpacity": 0.7,
        "strokeWidth": 1.5,
        "rx": 14
      }
    },
    "viz_howitworks_live": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "### Live mode — name a city\n\n- Set **City** (and **Country**, if the name is ambiguous) in the panel's data source options.\n- No index, saved search or API key is required.\n- Refreshes every 300 seconds by default; 60 seconds is the minimum.\n- Needs internet access to [open-meteo.com](https://open-meteo.com/) from the viewer's browser.",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent",
        "fontColor": "#e6ecf4",
        "fontSize": "small"
      }
    },
    "viz_search_card": {
      "type": "splunk.rectangle",
      "options": {
        "fillColor": "#2f1f3d",
        "fillOpacity": 1,
        "strokeColor": "#c089f0",
        "strokeOpacity": 0.7,
        "strokeWidth": 1.5,
        "rx": 14
      }
    },
    "viz_howitworks_search": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "### Search mode — use your own data\n\n- Set **Mode** to **Search**, then bind a search that returns a single row.\n- Required: wind direction in degrees (0–360, the direction the wind blows from) and wind speed. Both numeric.\n- Optional: location, country, temperature, gusts, weather code, day/night.\n- Names are mapped under **Search: field mapping**; the defaults match Open-Meteo's.",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent",
        "fontColor": "#e6ecf4",
        "fontSize": "small"
      }
    },
    "viz_label_dark": {
